{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52334","headline":"诗（幷序） 九十五 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 九十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天子与你官，俸禄生（项校「坐」）地（张改作「由他」）授。\n饮响（戴、项校「飨」）不知足，贪婪得动手。\n每怀劫贼心，恒张饿狼口。\n[枷]（加）锁忽然至，饭盖遭毒手。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52334.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52334","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}